be directory ob filename "examples/out/systemd-bridge" do

ob text quoted.text.
[Unit]
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/usr/local/bin/my-service
Restart=on-failure

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
.text.quoted to filename "examples/out/systemd-bridge/my-service.service" be write do

ob text "node command/systemd_bridge.mjs --action ini-to-pyash-map --input examples/out/systemd-bridge/my-service.service --output examples/out/systemd-bridge/my-service.map.pya --service-name \"my service\"" be command do

from filename "examples/out/systemd-bridge/my-service.map.pya" become wo text be read do
